{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Old Parliament House (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that South Australia's <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_Parliament_House,_Adelaide\" title=\"Old Parliament House, Adelaide\">Old Parliament House</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> and the present <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Parliament_House,_Adelaide\" title=\"Parliament House, Adelaide\">Parliament House</a> were jointly added to the Australian National Heritage List in 2006?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_Parliament_House,_Adelaide","retrieved":1791547325571},{"title":"Franz Schnyder (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franz_Schnyder\" title=\"Franz Schnyder\">Franz Schnyder</a></b> made his feature-film directorial debut after Swiss immigration authorities sought to prevent refugee filmmaker <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leopold_Lindtberg\" title=\"Leopold Lindtberg\">Leopold Lindtberg</a> from directing another army-friendly film?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franz_Schnyder","retrieved":1791547325572},{"title":"a 1914 referendum (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a Texas lawmaker voted to submit <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1914_Texas_Proposition_1\" title=\"1914 Texas Proposition 1\">a 1914 referendum</a></b> to voters while saying that he would \"vote and work against its adoption\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1914_Texas_Proposition_1","retrieved":1791547325576},{"title":"Gottlob Herbert Bidermann (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the English edition of <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gottlob_Herbert_Bidermann\" title=\"Gottlob Herbert Bidermann\">Gottlob Herbert Bidermann</a></b><span class=\"nowrap\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">'</span>s</span> Eastern Front memoir includes events absent from the German original, added 36 years later from interviews with him?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gottlob_Herbert_Bidermann","retrieved":1791547325586},{"title":"When I Was Done Dying (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dan_Deacon\" title=\"Dan Deacon\">Dan Deacon</a> wrote the song \"<b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/When_I_Was_Done_Dying\" title=\"When I Was Done Dying\">When I Was Done Dying</a></b>\" because he liked the idea that his body, memory and consciousness are \"three separate things that are constantly oscillating\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/When_I_Was_Done_Dying","retrieved":1791547325588},{"title":"attempting to assassinate Timothy Torlot (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a suicide bomber disguised himself as a schoolboy while <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attempted_assassination_of_Timothy_Torlot\" title=\"Attempted assassination of Timothy Torlot\">attempting to assassinate Timothy Torlot</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attempted_assassination_of_Timothy_Torlot","retrieved":1791547325590},{"title":"a professional sumo wrestler (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arashifuji_Kanato\" title=\"Arashifuji Kanato\">a professional sumo wrestler</a></b> first appeared on television as a competitor on the obstacle-course competition show <i><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sasuke_(TV_series)\" title=\"Sasuke (TV series)\">Sasuke Ninja Warrior</a></i><span style=\"padding-left:0.15em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">?</span></span>","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arashifuji_Kanato","retrieved":1791547325591},{"title":"Paramacrobiotus pius (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paramacrobiotus_pius\" title=\"Paramacrobiotus pius\">Paramacrobiotus pius</a></b></i> was described more than a decade after its type specimens were collected?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paramacrobiotus_pius","retrieved":1791547325594},{"title":"a shootout in Kyiv (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that two Ukrainian intelligence agencies had <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Kyiv_SBU–HUR_shootout\" title=\"2026 Kyiv SBU–HUR shootout\">a shootout in Kyiv</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Kyiv_SBU%E2%80%93HUR_shootout","retrieved":1791547325595},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt8\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwIQ\" data-mw=\"{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;banner&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Banner&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;direction&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;right&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Xi'an&quot;},&quot;type&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;dotm&quot;},&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;XianBanner1.jpg&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;China's ancient capital is the home of the Terracotta Warriors and has a history going back several millennia.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt9\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Banner/styles.css&quot;}}\">.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox{color:white;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h2,.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h3{color:white;border:none;font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.2em;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox a{co